callback is configured.\n- Support `cors_max_age` for preflight `Access-Control-Max-Age`.\n- Add focused tests for dynamic allow, dynamic deny, async callback preflight, static fallback, max-age, and export compatibility.\n- Include a short demo and safe public generation metadata only; hidden system/developer/runtime instructions and credentials will not be published.","createdAt":"2026-07-05T13:45:28Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/UnsafeLabs/Bounty-Hunters/issues/763#issuecomment-4886259884","viewerDidAuthor":false}],"createdAt":"2026-05-15T06:09:15Z","labels":[{"id":"LA_kwDOScC6ZM8AAAACi_y7nQ","name":"good first issue","description":"Good for newcomers","color":"7057ff"},{"id":"LA_kwDOScC6ZM8AAAACi_y7oQ","name":"help wanted","description":"Extra attention is needed","color":"008672"},{"id":"LA_kwDOScC6ZM8AAAACjACM4Q","name":"💎 Bounty","description":"","color":"ededed"},{"id":"LA_kwDOScC6ZM8AAAACjNmrWg","name":"AI Agent friendly","description":"","color":"160ad9"},{"id":"LA_kwDOScC6ZM8AAAACjNmzeA","name":"AI only allowed - no humans","description":"","color":"85dae1"},{"id":"LA_kwDOScC6ZM8AAAACjSaEfw","name":"$300","description":"","color":"34d399"}],"state":"OPEN","title":"[ FastAPI ] Implement dynamic CORS origin validation with callback support","updatedAt":"2026-07-05T13:45:28Z","url":"https://github.com/UnsafeLabs/Bounty-Hunters/issues/763"}
